* Lead a team of Salesforce administrators, developers, and analysts to ensure the efficient and effective use of Salesforce to meet the organization's business needs.
* Play a pivotal role in overseeing and driving the successful implementation and management of CRM within the organization.
* Manage and lead various stages of Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) and initiatives that relate to the overall health of the environment;
* Maintain the functional areas of data integrity and object management, while providing solution support, development, testing and deployment.
* Lead a team of administrators and developers, providing guidance, support and mentoring as needed.
* Coordinate with cross-functional teams to align Salesforce with business processes and foster collaboration.

